# Copy to `.env` (ignored by git) and adjust for your machine.
#
# Expo Go + same Wi‑Fi: usually no `.env` needed — the app derives your PC IP
# from Metro and calls http://<that-ip>:5126 (see services/api.ts).
#
# Override (tunnel, different host/port, HTTPS):
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.10:5126
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://localhost:7061
